@startuml Round_State_Machine
skinparam state {
    BorderColor #2C3E50
    BackgroundColor #ECF0F1
    ArrowColor #2980B9
}
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Federated Learning - Round State Machine

[*] --> INIT : Initialize Experiment

INIT --> OPEN : Start New Round (round_id = t)
note right of OPEN
  - Publish global model v_t to Storage
  - Broadcast task config via /task
  - Set round deadline timer
end note

OPEN --> COLLECTING : First Valid Client Update Received
note right of COLLECTING
  - Accept updates via POST /update
  - Check idempotency (update_id)
  - Verify SHA-256 and client token
  - Reject duplicate / stale updates
end note

COLLECTING --> AGGREGATING : Quorum Met (count >= min_participants)\nOR (Timeout AND count >= min_participants)
note right of AGGREGATING
  - Lock round updates
  - Compute weighted FedAvg / FedProx
  - Evaluate new global model v_{t+1}
  - Persist round metrics to PostgreSQL
end note

COLLECTING --> FAILED : Timeout AND count < min_participants
note left of FAILED
  - Quorum not satisfied
  - Log failure reason in PostgreSQL
  - Trigger retry round or abort
end note

FAILED --> OPEN : Retry Round (Same or incremented round)
FAILED --> [*] : Max Round Retries Exceeded

AGGREGATING --> OPEN : Round Successful & round_id < max_rounds
note top of OPEN : round_id = t + 1

AGGREGATING --> DONE : Round Successful & round_id == max_rounds
note right of DONE
  - Export final model artifact (ONNX / safetensors)
  - Generate Markdown & JSON/CSV reports
  - Notify clients via GET /model/final
end note

DONE --> [*] : Experiment Complete

@enduml
